---
import SectionLabel from "./SectionLabel.astro";
import Button from "./Button.astro";
---

<section id="about" class="pt-6 pb-12 md:pt-12 md:pb-20 relative overflow-hidden bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8 lg:px-12">
    <!-- About Us Section with 10-Year Practice Case Study -->
    <div class="mb-3" data-animate="fade-up-sm">
      <SectionLabel text="About Us" />
    </div>

    <!-- Large Editorial Narrative Statement -->
    <div class="max-w-4xl mb-8 md:mb-10">
      <h2 data-animate="fade-up" class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-[3.25rem] font-bold text-[#030303] leading-[1.15] mb-4">
        380% Retainer Growth over 10 Years
      </h2>
      <p data-animate="fade-up-sm" data-animate-delay="1" class="text-lg sm:text-xl md:text-2xl font-medium text-neutral-800 leading-relaxed mb-3">
        How Dr. Ryan Diepenbrock (Diepenbrock Facial Cosmetic Surgery — Fort Wayne, IN) Scaled to Regional Market Dominance Across a Decade of Digital Shift.
      </p>
      <p data-animate="fade-up-sm" data-animate-delay="2" class="text-base sm:text-lg text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">
        In an industry where practices fire marketing agencies every 6 to 12 months, Dr. Diepenbrock has trusted our search and patient acquisition architecture for a decade. By evolving renewedlook.com from basic local search in 2016 to modern AI Search (AEO) and high-converting procedure hubs today, his monthly reinvestment grew nearly 4x—driven entirely by compounding patient consult revenue.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 2-Column Layout: Left = Eyeball Image, Right = Growth Timeline Block -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6 items-stretch">
      <!-- Left Column: Clean Eyeball Image -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 flex" data-animate="scale-in">
        <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl md:rounded-3xl shadow-lg border border-black/5 w-full h-full min-h-[320px] group bg-neutral-950 flex">
          <img
            src="/images/Eyeball BC.webp"
            alt="Specialized bionic eyeball digital aesthetic for plastic and facial cosmetic surgeons"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-105"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Growth Timeline & Retainer Expansion Block (replacing second image) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex" data-animate="scale-in" data-animate-delay="2">
        <div class="bg-neutral-50 border border-neutral-200/80 rounded-2xl md:rounded-3xl p-4 sm:p-5 shadow-lg w-full flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div class="mb-3">
            <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl md:text-3xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-[#050505] mb-1">
              Growth Timeline & Retainer Expansion
            </h3>
            <p class="text-[#050505]/70 text-xs sm:text-sm">
              A decade-long trajectory of expanding partnership and compounding patient consult revenue.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <div class="bg-white px-3 py-2 rounded-xl border border-neutral-200/80 shadow-sm flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-1.5">
              <span class="text-xs font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-100 text-cyan-800 w-fit">2016 • $1,000/mo</span>
              <span class="text-neutral-800 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium leading-snug text-left sm:text-right">Foundational Local Search & Core Pages</span>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white px-3 py-2 rounded-xl border border-neutral-200/80 shadow-sm flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-1.5">
              <span class="text-xs font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-100 text-cyan-800 w-fit">2018 • $1,500/mo</span>
              <span class="text-neutral-800 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium leading-snug text-left sm:text-right">Procedure Page Architecture & Gallery UX</span>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white px-3 py-2 rounded-xl border border-neutral-200/80 shadow-sm flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-1.5">
              <span class="text-xs font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-100 text-cyan-800 w-fit">2021 • $3,000/mo</span>
              <span class="text-neutral-800 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium leading-snug text-left sm:text-right">Map Pack Dominance & Mobile Conversion</span>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white px-3 py-2 rounded-xl border border-neutral-200/80 shadow-sm flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-1.5">
              <span class="text-xs font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-100 text-cyan-800 w-fit">2024 • $3,800/mo</span>
              <span class="text-neutral-800 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium leading-snug text-left sm:text-right">AI Search, GEO/AEO Authority & Entity Building</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
